summary.label:
NeoLight allows you to see who's calling at the door of your house; you can answer, open the door or the driveway gate, record photos / videos from the call panel or CCTV cameras on your device.

It's even possible to see the camera of the door panel from the app without receiving a call and to check other CCTV cameras connected to the installation as well. 

The app gives also an indication of the unanswered calls on which you didn't answer with indication of date, time and visitor's picture of each call. 

All these function can be added to your video door phone without changing it and without changing the building door phone system; it's enough to add our IP/WiFi NeoBox device in your apartment and to install the app on the smartphone. 

For a correct operation it's necessary an internet connection. The link with the router can be Wi-Fi or with a LAN cable  if the WiFi coverage is not possible. 

Main features of  the NeoLight APP:
•	push notifications of incoming calls;
•	an indication of the unanswered calls on which you didn't answer with indication of date, time and visitor's picture of each call.
•	video call from a visitor;
•	communication with the visitor, open the door or the driveway gate;
•	to record photos / videos from the call panel or cameras on your smartphone;
•	to see the camera of the door panel from the app without receiving a call and to check other CCTV cameras connected to the installation as well;
•	to switch the resolution of SD / HD in case of poor connection;
•	two-way audio communication.
